WAP to print example of Multi Catch Exception:

public class Main{
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try{
            int a = 8;
            int b = 42/a;
        }
       
        catch (ArithmeticException e){
            System.out.println("This is never reached");
        }


        catch (Exception e)
        {
            System.out.println("Generic Exception Catch");
        }
       
   
 
}
}
